# (b) The user returns before 20 min: turn.start cancels the timer; the next turn end re-arms it.
title:   Coming back early cancels the timer
caption: The user returns after nine minutes. The new turn.start cancels the pending timer, so nothing is compacted mid-thought. When that turn completes, a fresh 20-minute timer is armed.
note:    1 column = 1 minute; the ≈ break skips ten quiet minutes. Every turn end re-arms from zero; there is never more than one timer.
break:   +10 min

time        0    5m   10m  15m  ≈ 30m
claude   -S~E--------S~~~E------≈-----
timer       [========x   [======≈====>
compact  -----------------------≈-----

legend
S  turn.start      blue
~  turn            teal
E  turn.complete — arms the timer  teal
=  idle timer · 20 min  violet
x  cancelled — by turn.start  coral
